================================================================================
NOTICE ON DATA AND THIRD-PARTY CONTENT
================================================================================

This license applies ONLY to the source code in this repository.

1. Yelp dataset
   The analysis in this repository uses the Yelp academic dataset. The dataset
   itself is NOT included here and is NOT covered by this license. It remains
   subject to Yelp's own Data Use Agreement, which prohibits redistribution.
   See DATA.md for how to obtain it legitimately.

2. OpenStreetMap
   Map imagery and street geometry are derived from OpenStreetMap, which is
   (c) OpenStreetMap contributors and licensed under the Open Database License
   (ODbL), https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/ .
   No map tiles or vector caches are redistributed here; they are re-fetched by
   the scripts under analysis/.

3. Derived aggregate results
   The aggregate tables and figures under analysis/out/ are derived from the
   Yelp dataset. They are published as summary statistics and visualisations
   only. Per-business records are deliberately excluded.
